#### The Cautions for Project 2 (The Visionary's Gamble)

1.  **Risk of Building on a Metaphor:** The "System 1/2" analogy is powerful for explaining behavior, but it may not map cleanly onto neural network mechanisms. You will spend significant effort just defining and creating your "System 2" model before you can even get to the core of the project (the merging).
